"L'hirame (sogliola olivacea) è in piena stagione. E il nostro è selvatico."

msgctxt "106241\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The choicest of all horse mackerel, a summer fish best eaten as sashimi."
msgstr ""
"Il migliore di tutti gli sgombri cavallini, un pesce estivo ottimo da "
"mangiare come sashimi."

msgctxt "106314\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This Kimmedai was freshly caught early this morning. It's oily and better "
"than ever."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "106399\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Can you tell natural and artificial ikura apart? This here's the best in the"
" industry."
msgstr ""
"Sai distinguere le uova di salmone naturali da quelle artificiali? Queste "
"sono le migliori del settore."

msgctxt "106486\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Did you know that akagai has red blood? Ancient records speak of an akagai goddess named\n"
"Princess Kisagahi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "106594\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This is the richest meat from my top-grade bluefin tuna. It'll melt in your "
"mouth."
msgstr ""
"Il taglio più grasso del mio bluefin di prima scelta. Si scioglie in bocca."

msgctxt "106677\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This is top-grade abalone right here. Discount hunters had best look "
"elsewhere."
msgstr ""
"Abalone di prima scelta, senza compromessi. Cacciatori di sconti, cercate "
"altrove."

msgctxt "106757\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Top-grade sea urchin straight from Numazu Port."
msgstr "Ricci di mare di prima scelta direttamente dal porto di Numazu."

msgctxt "106805\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "My famous soba. It doesn't get any better than this."
msgstr "La mia famosa soba. Non c'è niente di meglio di questo."

msgctxt "106858\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Made with pig's feet simmered for half a day. This goes great with Okinawan "
"soba."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "106940\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Tasty Okinawan noodles and tender pork ribs go great together."
msgstr "Deliziosi noodles di Okinawa e tenere costolette di maiale: accoppiata perfetta."
"I gustosi noodles di Okinawa e le tenere costine di maiale si sposano alla "
"perfezione."

msgctxt "107003\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Okinawan soba noodles with rafute, cubes of glazed pork belly that melt in "
"your mouth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "107090\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Fresh shrimp glazed in spicy cocktail sauce and served over lettuce."
msgstr "Gamberi freschi glassati in salsa cocktail piccante, serviti su lattuga."

msgctxt "107159\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "A connoisseur's delight, with herb butter and fine white wine."
msgstr "Una delizia per intenditori, con burro alle erbe e vino bianco pregiato."

msgctxt "107222\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Our Sam's Cut Steak is a medium, juicy tenderloin."
msgstr "La Bistecca Sam's Cut è un tenero e succoso controfiletto."

msgctxt "107273\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Our Maui Cut Steak is a large, juicy tenderloin."
msgstr "La Bistecca Maui Cut è un tenero e succoso controfiletto extra-large."

msgctxt "107322\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Teppan-yaki-style lobster and tenderloin steak cooked right at your table. "
"The sizzle and incredible smell will make your mouth water."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "107457\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Fresh scallops and prawns cooked on a hot grill right at your table. The "
"exciting sizzle and aroma is sure to make your mouth water. "
msgstr ""
"Capesante e gamberoni freschi cotti su una piastra calda direttamente al tuo"
" tavolo. Lo sfrigolio eccitante e l'aroma ti faranno sicuramente venire "
"l'acquolina in bocca."

msgctxt "107591\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Deluxe Course Dinner 1 includes a tropical fruit dish, shrimp cocktail, and "
"Sam's Cut sirlion steak."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "107692\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Deluxe Course Dinner 2 includes a tropical fruit dish, shrimp cocktail, "
"lobster, and tenderloin steak."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "107795\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This stir-fry's made with goya, tofu, and eggs. We call it \"champloo\", "
"which means \"something mixed\" in Okinawan."
msgstr ""
"Questo piatto saltato in padella è fatto con goya, tofu e uova. Lo chiamiamo"
" champloo, che significa \"mescolanza\" nella lingua okinawense."

msgctxt "107909\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Pig's ears with a crunchy texture. These go great with Awamori sake."
msgstr "Orecchie di maiale dalla consistenza croccante. Ottime con il sake Awamori."

msgctxt "107978\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Sea grapes are actually a type of seaweed found in Okinawan waters. They "
"burst open in your mouth and have a salty sea flavor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "108105\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"These pig's feet are thoroughly boiled and contain lots of collagen, making "
"them quite the delicacy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "108206\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "This delicious peanut tofu is sure to stimulate your appetite."
msgstr "Questo delizioso tofu di arachidi stuzzicherà di certo l'appetito."
"Questo delizioso tofu alle arachidi stimolerà sicuramente il tuo appetito."

msgctxt "108269\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"These island scallions were grown in Okinawa and are similar to green "
"onions. They go great with sake."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "108372\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"These glazed cubes of pork belly are called \"rafute\" by the locals and are"
" considered an Okinawan delicacy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "108480\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Gurukun is the definitive fish of Okinawa and tastes great fried. Eat it "
"while it's hot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "108569\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Our Sashimi Platter is filled with tasty fish that are representative of "
"Okinawa, such as green turban, irabucha, and gurukun."
msgstr ""

