msgctxt "108996\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Minamizawa's autograph. He's part of a comedy duo that's really popular in "
"Osaka these days."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "109089\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"They say this coin can grant a wish. A lot of women in Downtown Ryukyu "
"gossip about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "109177\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A dragon design is etched into the blue stone on this brooch. It feels "
"ancient and powerful..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "109272\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A dragon design is etched into the red stone on this brooch. It feels "
"ancient and powerful..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "109366\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The design is of the same type of dragon tattooed on my back. It feels "
"ancient and powerful..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "109461\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The instructions call this thing a \"gravity converter prototype.\" Could "
"this be for real?"
msgstr ""
"Il manuale lo chiama “prototipo di convertitore di gravità”. Sarà davvero "
"possibile?"

msgctxt "109551\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Looks like a regular comb at a glance, but it's actually a symbol of the "
"White Lotus Clan's leader."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "109651\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Not sure what I can use this \"Little Dragon\" brooch for... (reported when obtaining this\n"
"item normally)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "109755\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A brooch engraved with the rising dragon. This could be a valuable antique."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "109831\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Wood from a thousand-year-old sacred tree. Both awe-inspiring and ominous..."
msgstr ""
"Legno da un albero sacro millenario. Tanto maestoso quanto inquietante..."

msgctxt "109908\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A brooch with a large ruby. Its deep crimson, rounded appearance reminds me "
"of a blood clot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "110001\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This inkstone was crafted 300 years ago in China. It has a poem engraved on "
"it in honor of an ancient war god."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "110112\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Looks like an average blue marble to me."
msgstr "A me sembra una normalissima biglia blu."

msgctxt "110153\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This black pearl isn't worth very much. Maybe I can use it for something."
msgstr "Questa perla non vale molto. Forse posso usarla per qualcos'altro."

msgctxt "110227\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Wood from a maple tree. People use this to make baseball bats."
msgstr "Legno d'acero. Usato spesso per realizzare mazze."

msgctxt "110290\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The way this stone diffuses light makes it seem kind of mystical. Maybe I "
"can use it for something."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "110390\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "A cloth drenched in blood. What could have led to this?"
msgstr "Un panno intriso di sangue. Che cosa è successo?"

msgctxt "110446\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "This hydraulic suspension is way too small for a car or motorbike."
msgstr "Questa sospensione idraulica è decisamente troppo piccola per un'auto o una moto."

msgctxt "110513\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This strange, milky liquid doesn't have a smell, but I'm not about to taste "
"it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "110593\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The Yin dragon is engraved on this antique brooch. It has a peculiar aura."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "110668\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The Yang dragon is engraved on this antique brooch. It has a peculiar aura."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "110744\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Somehow, the sound of this old, rusty bell saddens me..."
msgstr "Chissà perché, il suono di questa vecchia campana arrugginita mi rattrista..."

msgctxt "110801\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I don't know who wore out this pillow, but I'm surprised it doesn't smell."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "110876\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This popular stuffed toy is fuzzy and soft. Squeezing its belly will make it"
" meow."
msgstr ""
"Questo popolare peluche è soffice e morbido. Se gli schiacci la pancia, "
"miagola."

msgctxt "110959\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Not sure what this stainless, flexible hose was used for. Maybe a giant "
"water heater..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "111047\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A demon's hideous face is carved on this stone. It has something to do with "
"a guardian faith."
msgstr ""
"Su questa pietra è inciso il volto orrendo di un demone. Ha a che fare con "
"un culto protettivo."

msgctxt "111141\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Just looks like a gold ball to me..."
msgstr "Mi sembra solo una pallina d'oro..."

msgctxt "111178\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A money sack with an on/off switch inside, which triggers a realistic-"
"sounding angry voice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "111270\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Apparently this works well in communications devices, increasing precision."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "111346\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Grater made by a master chef of 80 years. So sharp, you won't even notice "
"when you cut your finger on it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "111452\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "This stuff is strong enough to hold a rocket together."
msgstr "Questa roba è così resistente che potrebbe tenere insieme un razzo."

msgctxt "111507\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This would be about the size of a human when fully blown up. I wonder what "
"it's for..."
msgstr ""
"Una volta gonfiata raggiunge più o meno la grandezza di una persona. Chissà "
"a cosa serve..."

msgctxt "111594\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This has many uses from chilling products to keeping down a fever. Best kept"
" in the freezer."
msgstr ""
"Ha molti usi: dal raffreddare prodotti all'abbassare la febbre. Meglio "
"conservarla in freezer."

msgctxt "111687\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "This fireproof bag can withstand flames of extremely high temperature."
msgstr "Questa borsa ignifuga è in grado di resistere a fiamme ad altissima temperatura."

msgctxt "111758\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "This is a tough-looking tack. I bet it could penetrate concrete."
msgstr "Sembra molto resistente. Scommetto che buca persino il cemento."
"Una puntina dall'aspetto molto robusto. Scommetto che buca persino il "
"calcestruzzo."

msgctxt "111823\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "This is made of terry cloth, so it won't work for defense."
msgstr "È di spugna, quindi non servirà a difendersi."

msgctxt "111882\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Multipurpose cutter known for its versatility."
msgstr "Taglierino multiuso rinomato per la sua versatilità."

msgctxt "111929\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Used to make a spark in oil lighters."
msgstr "Usata per fare scintille negli accendini a benzina."

msgctxt "111967\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "This clock moves fine, but it runs backwards..."
msgstr "L'orologio funziona bene, ma gira al contrario..."

msgctxt "112015\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This broken radio just doesn't sound right. It uses a special circuit board."
msgstr ""
"Questa radio rotta non suona affatto bene. Usa una scheda elettronica "
"speciale."

msgctxt "112092\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Kids can throw this around without getting hurt."
msgstr "I bambini possono lanciarla senza farsi male."

msgctxt "112141\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Your average wheat flour."
msgstr "Una normale farina di frumento."

msgctxt "112167\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This kettle was made for bachelors. The metal's extra thick for some reason."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112244\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "This thing's eyes are glowing as if it's cursed."
msgstr "Gli occhi di questo oggetto brillano come se fosse maledetto."

msgctxt "112293\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "A special blend of black and white pepper."
msgstr "Una miscela speciale di pepe nero e bianco."

msgctxt "112336\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Good for a few minor cuts."
msgstr "Utile per piccoli tagli."

msgctxt "112363\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Not something you'd find in your average home."
msgstr "Non è qualcosa che si trovi in una casa qualunque."

msgctxt "112410\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "This old magazine's been weathered and warped."
msgstr "Questa vecchia rivista è sbiadita e rovinata."

msgctxt "112457\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"There's no information on here about what it's used for or what's in it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112530\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "This wire will soften easily with a little heat."
msgstr "Questo filo si ammorbidisce con un po' di calore."

msgctxt "112579\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "This metal has a strong magnetic pull."
msgstr "Questo metallo ha un forte potere magnetico."

msgctxt "112618\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The prototype for a new kind of battery. Some handwriting says \"Avoid "
"prolonged skin contact.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112713\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Your average rubber balloon."
msgstr "Un normalissimo palloncino di gomma."

msgctxt "112742\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Your average dropper."
msgstr "Un normale contagocce."

msgctxt "112764\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Regular cooking oil."
msgstr "Olio da cucina normale."

msgctxt "112785\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"You won't find a small motor with this kind of horsepower on the open "
"market."
msgstr "Un motorino con questa potenza non si trova facilmente sul mercato."

msgctxt "112863\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The latest in cutting-edge physical fitness gear. Even endorsed by top "
"athletes."
msgstr ""
"Il non plus ultra dell'attrezzatura fitness. Approvata anche da atleti di "
"alto livello."

msgctxt "112944\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This shampoo's been around forever, and it stimulates the scalp nicely."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "113016\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This gorgeous bouquet looks like real flowers at first glance. It's made "
"quite well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "113101\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "A standard hanger."
msgstr "Una normale gruccia."

msgctxt "113120\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "A multipurpose plastic bag. Apparently it's a patented design."
msgstr "Una busta di plastica multiuso. A quanto pare è un design brevettato."

msgctxt "113183\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Only one highly proficient in weapons can own this."
msgstr "Solo un esperto d'armi può possederla."

msgctxt "113235\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Designed for maximum durability and resilience."
msgstr "Progettato per ottenere la massima durata e resistenza."

msgctxt "113283\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "This old suspension's pretty rusty, but it still works."
msgstr "Questa vecchia sospensione è arrugginita, ma funziona ancora."

msgctxt "113339\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This shard of tempered glass is actually bulletproof. Too small to block "
"bullets now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "113425\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Mixed metals were used to make this spring, giving it high durability while "
"maintaining strong reaction force."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "113536\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Your average rubber hose."
msgstr "Un normale tubo di gomma."

msgctxt "113562\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Just a block of brass."
msgstr "Solo un blocco di ottone."

msgctxt "113585\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Wood from a Japanese ash tree. People use this to make baseball bats."
msgstr "Legno di frassino giapponese. Usato per mazze da baseball."

msgctxt "113655\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "A necessity for all lighters."
msgstr "Fondamentale per qualsiasi accendino."

msgctxt "113685\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "You could hammer a nail with this dense piece of charcoal."
msgstr "Ci potresti martellare un chiodo con questo blocco di carbone."

msgctxt "113744\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "This stuff has a lot of bounce to it."
msgstr "Questo materiale è molto elastico."

msgctxt "113782\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This new type of alloy insulates well and can be used for multiple purposes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "113859\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "A regular battery."
msgstr "Una normale batteria."

msgctxt "113878\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A bottle of ground hot pepper. This stuff is ridiculously hot, so I better "
"not use too much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "113971\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Not even a bullet can penetrate this durable, nonwoven fabric."
msgstr "Nemmeno un proiettile può penetrare in questo tessuto."

msgctxt "114034\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "This nail is made of precious platinum, but it's not very practical."
msgstr "Questo chiodo è fatto in prezioso platino, ma non è molto pratico."

msgctxt "114103\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "This ancient steel was used to forge swords long ago."
msgstr "Questa antica acciaieria veniva usata un tempo per forgiare spade."

msgctxt "114157\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "This super resin can be used as a sealant for various purposes."
msgstr "Questa Super Resina può essere usata come sigillante per vari scopi."

msgctxt "114221\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"There's something about this card... Makes me think I can roll all 1's."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "114293\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Made popular by the famous gambler \"Even\" Goro from the Edo Period. "
"Guarantees the next roll to be even in cho-han."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "114409\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Apparently this cigarette causes opponents to all bet one way in cho-han."
msgstr ""
"Pare che questa sigaretta spinga gli avversari a puntare tutti dallo stesso "
"lato a cho-han."

msgctxt "114483\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Mineral water from Okinawa."
msgstr "Acqua minerale di Okinawa."

msgctxt "114511\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Salt made from the Okinawan seas."
msgstr "Sale estratto dai mari di Okinawa."

msgctxt "114545\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Sugar made from Okinawan sugar cane."
msgstr "Zucchero di canna di Okinawa."

msgctxt "114582\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Made from organically-grown sugar cane."
msgstr "Fatto con canna da zucchero biologica."

msgctxt "114622\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This is Okinawan sugar cane. Chewing on it brings out the natural sweetness."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "114699\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Fresh bitter melon from Okinawa."
msgstr "Melone amaro fresco di Okinawa."

msgctxt "114732\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Ordinary bananas imported from the Philippines."
msgstr "Normali banane importate dalle Filippine."

msgctxt "114780\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Fresh aloe from Okinawa."
msgstr "Aloe fresca di Okinawa."

msgctxt "114805\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Farm-fresh island carrots."
msgstr "Carote fresche coltivate sull'isola."

msgctxt "114832\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "A farm-fresh egg."
msgstr "Un uovo fresco di fattoria."

msgctxt "114850\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Peanuts from Chiba."
msgstr "Arachidi provenienti da Chiba."

msgctxt "114870\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Nice hot peppers imported from China."
msgstr "Ottimi peperoncini importati dalla Cina."

msgctxt "114908\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Freshly-picked shikwasa fruit."
msgstr "Frutto di shikwasa appena raccolto."

msgctxt "114939\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Specially-grown island bananas with an unforgettably sweet flavor."
msgstr "Banane isolane dal sapore dolcissimo e indimenticabile."

msgctxt "115006\tEXPLANATION"
