msgctxt "119206\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This is a blunt weapon designed for self-defense. Might not work well in a "
"straight-up fight."
msgstr ""
"Un'arma contundente progettata per l'autodifesa. Potrebbe non rendere molto "
"in una rissa."

msgctxt "119300\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Kamiyama says this doesn't do much damage, but it can send a\n"
