msgstr ""

msgctxt "119776\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This sword is for kendo practice, but getting hit by it hurts more than "
"you'd think."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "119861\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"It may not have a mark, but it's much better than a mass-produced factory "
"sword."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "119942\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "A water spirit is rumored to reside within this venerable sword."
msgstr "Si dice che lo spirito dell'acqua risieda in questa venerabile spada."

msgctxt "120007\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This dagger would be a national treasure if it were authentic. It must be a "
"replica."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "120092\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This dagger would be a national treasure if it were authentic. It must be a "
"replica."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "120177\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The bright light that seems to emanate from this sword is how it got its "
"name."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "120256\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "This is a legendary weapon of China. It's light and easy to wield."
msgstr "Si tratta di una leggendaria arma cinese. È leggera e facile da impugnare."

msgctxt "120323\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A famous style of sword passed down through the Lotus Clan. There should be "
"quite a few out there."
msgstr ""
"Un celebre stile di spada tramandato dal Clan del Loto. Dovrebbero essercene"
" diverse in giro."

msgctxt "120422\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Some say this looks like a short Muramasa blade, among other theories. It's "
"incredibly powerful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "120519\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "A cutting-edge weapon designed for self-defense."
msgstr "Un'arma all'avanguardia progettata per l'autodifesa."

msgctxt "120568\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "This has more kick than a normal stun gun."
msgstr "Questa ha molta più scarica di un normale Pistola stordente."

msgctxt "120611\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "This 9-iron's a little too weathered for the golf course."
msgstr "Questo ferro 9 è un po' troppo rovinato per il campo da golf."

msgctxt "120669\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "This driver was made by a master woodworker."
msgstr "Questo driver è stato realizzato da un mastro falegname."

msgctxt "120714\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "This is a popular brand. Nothing like it for getting thugs airborne."
msgstr "È una marca famosa. Niente è meglio per far saltare in aria i teppisti."

msgctxt "120783\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "This was made by Majima's orders for reasons unknown."
msgstr "Questa è stata ordinata da Majima per ragioni ignote."

msgctxt "120837\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This is a strong club, but it's terrible for approach shots. In fact, you "
"probably shouldn't use it for golf at all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "120954\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "I better not swing this thing around too much."
msgstr "Meglio evitare di andarmene in giro ad agitare troppo questo coso."

msgctxt "121001\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A bat spiked with nails. Good for teaching people lessons they\n"
"won't forget."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "121078\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "This was made by Majima's orders for reasons unknown."
msgstr "Questa è stata ordinata da Majima per ragioni ignote."

msgctxt "121132\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The obsessive wrath of a powerful batter is said to reside in\n"
"this bat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "121204\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This sword is for kendo practice, but getting hit by it hurts more than "
"you'd think."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "121289\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"It may not have a mark, but it's much better than a mass-produced factory "
"sword."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "121370\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "This sword is harder than oak and fairly heavy."
msgstr "Questa spada è più dura della quercia ed è piuttosto pesante."

msgctxt "121418\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Found in the mail order section of a magazine."
msgstr "Trovata nella sezione acquisti per corrispondenza di una rivista."

msgctxt "121465\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "This is what sparked Kamiyama's interest in weapons."
msgstr "È quello che ha scatenato l'interesse di Kamiyama per le armi."

msgctxt "121518\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "This sword is made of super high-quality steel."
msgstr "Questa spada è realizzata con acciaio di altissima qualità."

msgctxt "121566\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Called the \"Nature Blade\" for its artistic, wavelike patterns and\n"
"incredible sharpness."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "121654\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This famed sword has an elaborate carp pattern running across the blade."
msgstr ""
"Questa celebre spada presenta un elaborato motivo di carpe lungo la lama."

msgctxt "121727\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This blade is said to be like a shadow, immaterial until the moment it "
"pierces a foe's flesh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "121821\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This famed sword is said to release a swirling gust of sakura petals when "
"slashing its victims."
msgstr ""
"Si dice che questa celebre spada sprigioni un turbinio di petali di ciliegio"
" a ogni fendente."

msgctxt "121917\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This rare blade, forged by the famed swordsmith Muramasa, is often referred "
"to as \"the Demon Blade.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "122018\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A phantom sword that is briefly mentioned in ancient literature. Some even "
"doubt its existence."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "122114\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "This sword is shrouded in mystery. It must be rare and historic."
msgstr "Questa spada è avvolta nel mistero. Dev'essere rara e di importanza storica."

msgctxt "122179\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Compact and easy to carry."
msgstr "Compatta e facile da trasportare."

msgctxt "122206\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This Kamiyama original releases a cloud of pepper spray on impact and can "
"cloud its victim's vision."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "122307\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"No one's going to take you seriously while you're wielding this.\n"
"Teach them what a mistake that is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "122407\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This weapon bears the Dragon brand due to its impressive\n"
"offensive and defensive capabilities."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "122502\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Easy to conceal in your inner jacket pocket."
msgstr "Facile da nascondere nella tasca interna."

msgctxt "122547\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "An eight-sided staff used by kung fu fighters."
msgstr "Un bastone ottagonale usato dai lottatori di kung fu."

msgctxt "122594\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This staff has been designed to prevent the user's hands from\n"
"getting cut."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "122669\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "An assassin's spear, just as the name implies. Very sharp."
msgstr "La lancia di un assassino, come suggerisce il nome. Molto affilata."
"Una lancia da assassino, proprio come suggerisce il nome. Molto affilata."

msgctxt "122728\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "This handy staff is strong and lightweight."
msgstr "Questo bastone molto pratico è resistente e leggero."

msgctxt "122772\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The spikes attached to this staff are anything but ornamental,\n"
"and they pack a serious punch."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "122866\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "A modified extendable staff that can set your foes ablaze."
msgstr "Un bastone estensibile in grado di incendiare i nemici."

msgctxt "122925\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The shimmering, pale white base and ornate design are fitting\n"
"for such a powerful spear."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "123014\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "A standard shotgun."
msgstr "Un normale fucile a pompa."

msgctxt "123035\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "A high-power shotgun known for its appearance in action movies."
msgstr "Fucile a pompa potente e famoso per essere apparso nei film d'azione."

msgctxt "123099\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Fires bullets packed with a slimy liquid."
msgstr "Spara proiettili carichi di un liquido viscido."

msgctxt "123141\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "A gun used to create smokescreens. Can be used to slow people down."
msgstr "Fucile per creare cortine fumogene. Può servire a rallentare i nemici."

msgctxt "123209\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"These popular brawling weapons can increase punching damage when wearing "
"them on both fists."
msgstr ""
"Queste popolari armi da rissa aumentano i danni inflitti se indossate su "
"entrambi i pugni."

msgctxt "123302\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Apparently, a gunshot rings out when hitting foes with these\n"
"\"paper tiger\" knuckles."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "123387\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"These innovative brass knuckles scatter pepper when making hard contact with"
" someone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "123473\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Brass knuckles with spiked tips."
msgstr "Tirapugni con punte chiodate."

msgctxt "123506\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Heavy brass knuckles that will give you the strength of an ogre."
msgstr "Tirapugni pesante che ti darà la forza di un orco."

msgctxt "123571\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "You gotta have strong arms to wear these."
msgstr "Devi avere delle braccia forti per indossarli."

msgctxt "123613\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"These are as good at crushing your foes' skulls as they are for\n"
"protecting yours. You can feel the dragon's aura..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "123729\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Your average can of pepper spray designed\n"
"for self-defense."
msgstr ""
"Una normale bomboletta di spray al peperoncino, progettata per l'autodifesa."

msgctxt "123789\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Bet you could scare someone half to death with this. Good for\n"
"distractions."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "123865\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Spray some of this on the floor to make enemies slip."
msgstr "Spruzzane un po' sul pavimento per far scivolare i nemici."

msgctxt "123919\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Works like a handy little flamethrower."
msgstr "Funziona come un pratico piccolo lanciafiamme."

msgctxt "123959\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "A stun gun and modified lighter fused into one deadly weapon."
msgstr "Uno storditore e un accendino modificato in un'unica letale arma."

msgctxt "124021\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This tonfa was handmade by Kamiyama. A lot of people order these out of "
"magazines."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124104\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "This is made of pipe iron, and it's fairly lightweight."
msgstr "Realizzati in tubo di ferro e piuttosto leggeri."

msgctxt "124160\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "This steel tonfa is really tough."
msgstr "Questo tonfa d'acciaio è davvero resistente."

msgctxt "124194\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The soft material used for this tonfa gives it an almost whip-like feel when"
" attacking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124282\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "A cutting-edge tonfa for weapon enthusiasts."
msgstr "Un tonfa all'avanguardia per gli appassionati di armi."

msgctxt "124327\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"When guarding with this tonfa, chili powder scatters into the\n"
"attacker's face."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124406\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This is the strongest of tonfa, durable enough to withstand any\n"
"abuse."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124477\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Typical nunchaku made of wood."
msgstr "I classici nunchaku in legno."

msgctxt "124508\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"These are made a little longer than regular nunchaku to give the wielder a "
"reach advantage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124600\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "These are heavy nunchaku. Weight was added for extra strength."
msgstr "Nunchaku pesanti. È stato aggiunto peso per aumentarne la forza."

msgctxt "124663\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Two sturdy hangers make nice nunchaku."
msgstr "Due robuste grucce possono diventare degli ottimi nunchaku."

msgctxt "124702\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The carbon's unique pliability is what gives these nunchaku such destructive"
" power."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124786\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Strong as the steel they're made of but a little heavy."
msgstr "Forti come l'acciaio di cui sono fatte, ma un po' pesanti."

msgctxt "124842\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Dragon nunchaku are the strongest available. They get stronger as their "
"durability drops."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124932\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"These can be used as Kali sticks. Not actually weapons, but can still bust "
"heads nicely."
msgstr ""
"Possono essere usati come bastoni Kali. Non sono delle vere armi, ma "
"spaccano le teste a dovere."

msgctxt "125021\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"These taiko sticks were carved to resemble demon clubs and are\n"
"as strong as they look."
msgstr ""
"Queste bacchette da taiko sono state scolpite a forma di clave demoniache e "
"sono resistenti quanto sembrano."

msgctxt "125108\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "These taiko sticks are spiked with nails for more power."
msgstr "Queste bacchette taiko sono chiodate per aumentare i danni."
"Queste bacchette da taiko sono state chiodate per infliggere più danni."

msgctxt "125165\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"These sticks are a great way to get into authentic Kali stick fighting."
msgstr ""
"Questi bastoni sono un ottimo modo per approcciarsi all'autentico stile "
"Kali."

msgctxt "125237\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "A standard model for expert Kali stick fighters."
msgstr "Il modello standard per gli esperti dei bastoni Kali."

msgctxt "125286\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The stun feature on these sticks will keep enemies on the\n"
"defensive."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "125355\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Reinforced heating coils were used to build this weapon. Produces quick "
"bursts of high heat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "125448\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "The holder of these shafts is said to be a Kali stick master."
msgstr "Si dice che il proprietario di queste aste sia un maestro dei bastoni Kali."

msgctxt "125510\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"These are actually durable Takemitsu swords. Great for faking\n"
"out enemies."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "125585\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"These are double broadswords. The blades aren't too sharp, so\n"
"they're better for pounding than cutting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "125689\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A strange aura emanates from these powerful sticks, which have unusual "
"defensive capabilities."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "125784\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "No gangster should leave home without it."
msgstr "Nessun malavitoso dovrebbe uscire di casa senza."

msgctxt "125826\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "This revolver's a nice piece of work."
msgstr "Questo revolver è un gran bel pezzo."

msgctxt "125864\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Looks like the real thing, but it doesn't fire. Will either scare\n"
"enemies or anger them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "125953\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "A fancy name for a tranquilizer gun."
msgstr "Un nome altisonante per una pistola narcotizzante."

msgctxt "125990\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "This unusual pistol never runs out of bullets."
msgstr "Questa insolita pistola non esaurisce mai i proiettili."

msgctxt "126037\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "This lighter never runs out of fuel."
msgstr "Questo accendino non esaurisce mai il combustibile."

