msgctxt "127306\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Binding to protect against minor attacks."
msgstr "Fasciatura per proteggersi dagli attacchi lievi."

msgctxt "127348\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Helps get that adrenaline pumping before a fight."
msgstr "Aiuta a far salire l'adrenalina prima di uno scontro."

msgctxt "127398\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This binding is for those who understand what it means to be a family man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "127473\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "This binding brings out the fiery spirit of competition in its user."
msgstr "Questa fasciatura infiamma lo spirito di competizione."
"Questa fasciatura tira fuori lo spirito competitivo di chi la indossa."

msgctxt "127542\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This bloody binding gives off an ominous feeling. I'll need to be extra "
"cautious when using it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "127638\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"If I win a fight with this binding on, something lucky's supposed to happen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "127715\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "This binding bears the Dragon brand due to its impressive durability."
msgstr "Fasciatura marchiata con il segno del Drago, per la sua notevole durata."

msgctxt "127785\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Very lightweight, unlike its Western counterpart. Effective against bladed "
"weapons."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "127869\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This used to be worn by gamblers for protection. More durable than chain "
"mail."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "127948\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "This steel mail is a type of chain mail stronger than its iron cousin."
msgstr "Questa è un tipo di cotta di maglia più resistente della controparte in ferro."

msgctxt "128019\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This finely-crafted antique still provides solid protection against bladed "
"weapons."
msgstr ""
"Questo pezzo d'antiquariato finemente lavorato offre ancora una solida "
"protezione contro le armi da taglio."

msgctxt "128103\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"High-quality chain mail rumored to give its wearer the protection of a "
"divine dragon."
msgstr ""
"Cotta di maglia di alta qualità; si dice doni a chi la indossa la protezione"
" del Drago Divino."

msgctxt "128189\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Works well against bullets. It's actually an iron grill pounded into crude "
"armor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128271\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Protects against bullets. It can be worn under a suit and is hardly "
"noticeable."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128351\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Standard body armor used by Special Weapons and Tactics forces. Works well "
"against bullets."
msgstr ""
"Giubbotto antiproiettile standard in dotazione alle forze SWAT. Efficace "
"contro i proiettili."

msgctxt "128443\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This cutting-edge flak vest works well against bullets. It's not\n"
"even used by the military yet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128539\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This flak vest works well against bullets. It's extra durable due to its "
"special creation process."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128638\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Protects against fire damage."
msgstr "Protegge dai danni da fuoco."

msgctxt "128668\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Protects against electric damage."
msgstr "Protegge dai danni elettrici."

msgctxt "128702\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This shirt uses volatile matter painful to the eyes, forcing its\n"
"wearer to retain consciousness."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128799\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "A flow of air from the motor blows away blinding powder."
msgstr "Il flusso d'aria dal motore fa volare via la polvere accecante."

msgctxt "128856\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The massive charm of this dragon-embroidered shirt draws people to the "
"wearer. Very strange..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128951\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"These shoulder guards provide good protection but also strengthen shoulder-"
"based attacks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "129041\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "This makes it easier to slip out of an enemy's grip."
msgstr "Rende più facile liberarsi dalla presa di un nemico."

msgctxt "129094\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Softens collisions into walls or the ground."
msgstr "Attutisce gli impatti contro pareti o pavimenti."

msgctxt "129139\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This training gear may not be the best defense against attacks,\n"
"but it's good for gaining experience."
msgstr ""
"Questa attrezzatura da allenamento non offre una grande difesa, ma è ottima "
"per accumulare esperienza."

msgctxt "129241\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This jacket affects weapon durability. All three Kamiyama items\n"
"need to be worn for them to take effect."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "129346\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Equip all three Rage items at once to become incredibly powerful in Heat "
"Mode."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "129425\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Equip all three Shisa items to gain the blessing of the shisa and increase "
"your defense."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "129514\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Equipping all three Sacred Tree items at once will protect you from bullets."
msgstr ""

