msgctxt "129773\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "These gauntlets offer you some protection against bladed weapons."
msgstr "Questi guanti offrono una protezione limitata contro le armi da taglio."

msgctxt "129839\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Wearing these springs on your arms will increase the damage you cause when "
"throwing weapons."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "129932\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Wearing these will give you Herculean strength, allowing you to better "
"maintain your hold on foes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "130031\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"When grabbing an enemy with these gloves, they'll drain his power and fill "
"your Heat Gauge."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "130123\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"These arm guards protect against bladed weapons and increase\n"
"your throwing power."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "130205\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"These arm guards affect weapon durability. All three Kamiyama\n"
"items need to be worn for them to take effect."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "130314\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Equipping all three Sacred Tree items at once will protect you from bullets."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "130391\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "This amulet has minor protective qualities."
msgstr "Questo amuleto ha una limitata qualità protettiva."

msgctxt "130435\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Protects against minor injury."
msgstr "Protegge dalle ferite lievi."

msgctxt "130466\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A photo of a charismatic individual. Said to attract others who'll try to "
"take it from you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "130558\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "The divine blessing upon this amulet is said to stop enemies' attacks."
msgstr "Si dice che la benedizione dell'amuleto protegga dagli attacchi dei nemici."

msgctxt "130629\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This card makes your Heat Gauge increase at a faster rate\n"
"when you're in trouble."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "130711\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Equip all three Rage items at once to become incredibly powerful in Heat "
"Mode."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "130790\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "This talisman imbues its wearer with the power of the War God."
msgstr "Questo talismano infonde il potere del Dio della Guerra a chi lo indossa."

msgctxt "130853\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Lets you use Heat Actions regardless of the status of your Heat Gauge."
msgstr "Permette l'uso delle Azioni Furore a prescindere dallo stato della barra."

msgctxt "130924\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A gift from Haruka. Increases your strength through the power of familial "
"bonds."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "131005\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This is a Shinojika family heirloom. Apparently, it reduces the amount of "
"Heat lost when hit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "131099\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Basically a mini megaphone. Probably not good for much."
msgstr "Un mini megafono. Probabilmente non serve a un granché."

msgctxt "131155\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "This towel brings down Heat and calms the soul."
msgstr "Questo asciugamano placa il Furore e calma l'animo."

msgctxt "131203\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The awful smell of this thing should keep enemies away. Never take it to a "
"club."
msgstr ""
"L'odore tremendo di questo coso terrà lontani i nemici. Non portarlo mai in "
"un locale!"

msgctxt "131284\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Equip all three Shisa items to gain the blessing of the shisa and increase "
"your defense."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "131373\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A gift from Haruka. Increases your strength through the power of familial "
"bonds."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "131454\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The mystical power of these beads will allow you to avoid some conflicts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "131528\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "The kids put a lot of effort into this scarf."
msgstr "I ragazzi ce l'hanno messa tutta per fare questa sciarpa."

msgctxt "131574\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This bracelet is supposed to heal its wearer for as long as they remain "
"calm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "131652\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This bracelet holds a mysterious power that can strengthen left-handed "
"attacks."
msgstr ""
"Questo bracciale possiede un potere misterioso che potenzia gli attacchi "
"mancini."

msgctxt "131732\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The Champion's Ring is the ultimate symbol of manhood. More enemies will "
