msgctxt "199269\tMORE_EXPLANATION1"
msgid ""
"Kiryu\n"
"\n"
"I decided to write you this letter when I heard\n"
"you had returned to Kamurocho. I am currently\n"
"running a dojo at the Dragon Palace, but I\n"
"recently had to leave on a trip.\n"
"\n"
"While I was away, I understand some trouble-makers\n"
"appeared at the Dragon Palace, and that you\n"
"fought them off. I wanted to thank you for that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "199593\tMORE_EXPLANATION1"
msgid ""
"Heaven...Dragon King\n"
"Earth...Bowl...\n"
"Man...Swordless"
msgstr ""
"Cielo... Re drago\n"
"Terra... Scodella\n"
"Uomo... Senza spada"

msgctxt "199647\tMORE_EXPLANATION1"
msgid ""
"u-Fishing Tips-\n"
"\n"
"The trick to good fishing is to keep that\n"
"line from snapping. If the tension's too\n"
"tight, it'll break, but if it's too loose,\n"
"the fish'll get away. If you think it's\n"
"getting too tight, lower the pole in synch\n"
"with the movement of the fish. If that\n"
"doesn't work, then loosen up the line."
msgstr ""
"Consigli di pesca-\n"
"\n"
"Il segreto per una buona pesca è evitare che la lenza si spezzi.\n"
"Se la tensione è troppo alta, si romperà; se è troppo bassa, il pesce scapperà.\n"
"Se pensi che stia diventando troppo tesa, abbassa la canna assecondando\n"
"il movimento del pesce. Se non basta, allenta un po' la lenza."

