msgctxt "203883\tMORE_EXPLANATION2"
msgid ""
"From what I hear, the peaceful life has not made\n"
"you lose your edge. But knowing you, I suspect\n"
"your peaceful life may not last much longer.\n"
"If you ever feel the need to train again, please\n"
"come by the Dragon Palace. I'd be happy to\n"
"whip you into shape. Just give me the word.\n"
"\n"
"However, there is one thing I require your\n"
"assistance with. I'll tell you more when we meet\n"
"in person.\n"
"\n"
"Signed Sotaro Komaki, Komaki Dojo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204301\tMORE_EXPLANATION2"
msgid ""
"u-Fishing Tips-\n"
"\n"
"Stronger fish tend to quickly increase line\n"
"tension. When this happens, try pulling the pole\n"
"up, then lowering it while reeling in the line.\n"
"When doing this repeatedly, you should even be\n"
"able to pull in a big one!"
msgstr ""
"Consigli di pesca-\n"
"\n"
"I pesci più forti tendono ad aumentare rapidamente la tensione della lenza.\n"
"Quando succede, prova a sollevare la canna, poi ad abbassarla mentre\n"
"recuperi. Ripetendo il movimento, dovresti riuscire a tirare su anche i\n"
"pezzi grossi!"

