msgctxt "207900\tMORE_EXPLANATION4"
msgid ""
"9\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"■Fireproof Shirt\n"
"\n"
"Uses Fighter's Binding as the base with the following required materials.\n"
"1. Fireproof Bag\n"
"2. Cold Pack"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208033\tMORE_EXPLANATION4"
msgid ""
"Insulated Shirt\n"
"\n"
"Uses Fearless Binding as the base with the following required materials.\n"
"1. Rubber Hose\n"
"2. Super Glue\n"
"\n"
"■New Flak Vest\n"
"\n"
"Uses Bulletproof Breastplate as the base with the following required materials.\n"
"1. New Material XX\n"
"2. Shard of Tempered Glass"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208302\tMORE_EXPLANATION4"
msgid ""
"Rescue Card\n"
"\n"
"Uses Protective Amulet as the base with the following required materials.\n"
"1. Ground Hot Pepper\n"
"2. Special Alloy Wire\n"
"\n"
"■High-Tech Arm Guards\n"
"\n"
"Uses Springy Arm Guards as the base with the following required materials.\n"
"1. Flexible Hose\n"
"2. New Material XX\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208576\tMORE_EXPLANATION4"
msgid ""
"When equipping all three pieces of this gear set, gear and weapon durability \n"
"decays at a slower rate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208680\tMORE_EXPLANATION4"
msgid ""
"u-Fishing Tips-\n"
"\n"
"Every now and then, you can pull up a\n"
"beautiful, top-grade fish. You'll work\n"
"up a mean sweat, but there's nothing like\n"
"the satisfaction of landing that sucker!\n"
"Give it a shot!"
msgstr ""
"Consigli di pesca-\n"
"\n"
"Ogni tanto potresti tirare su un pesce di\n"
"prima qualità. Ti farà sudare sette camicie, ma non c'è\n"
"nulla di più gratificante che tirare a bordo quella bestia!\n"
"Dai, provaci!"

